    "title": "AKUH to start clinics on asthma and smoke cessation",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "The Pulmonary section, Department of Medicine, at Aga Khan University Hospital will start dedicated asthma and smoking cessation clinics from November 1, 2003.",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "6b18b3bac6515f0d",
        "component": "news_media",
        "role": "banner",
        "filename": "968-BannerImage.jpg",
